{"id":435,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"自律と宗教で育てる淳心学院の6年教育","feature_description":"淳心学院は、カトリック精神に基づく宗教教育、自律の精神、6年一貫のコース制、海外研修を通して主体性と視野を育てる男子校です。学校生活ページではクラブ活動が継続的に紹介され、学習と課外活動の両立を重視する姿勢がはっきり見えます。自分で考え、責任を持って動く学びが軸です。宗教と自律、コース制を土台に、将来を見据えて学び続ける姿勢を育てます。","clubs":[{"id":8513,"name":"野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.junshin.ed.jp/life/club/baseball","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8514,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.junshin.ed.jp/life/club/kendou","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8515,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.junshin.ed.jp/life/club/soccer","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8516,"name":"ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.junshin.ed.jp/life/club/softtennis","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8517,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.junshin.ed.jp/life/club/basketball","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8518,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.junshin.ed.jp/life/club/balleyball","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8519,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.junshin.ed.jp/life/club/tabletennis","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8520,"name":"音楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.junshin.ed.jp/life/club/music","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8521,"name":"鉄道研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.junshin.ed.jp/life/club/railway","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8522,"name":"生物部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.junshin.ed.jp/life/club/biological","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8523,"name":"化学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.junshin.ed.jp/life/club/chemistry","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8524,"name":"E.S.S","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.junshin.ed.jp/life/club/ess","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8525,"name":"軽音楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.junshin.ed.jp/life/club/band","verified_at":"2026-08